%N A288031 Number of edge covers in the grid graph P_3 X P_n.
%H A288031 Andrew Howroyd, <a href="/A288031/b288031.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..200</a>
%H A288031 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (20,100,24,-95,10,8).
%F A288031 Empirical: a(n) = 20*a(n-1) + 100*a(n-2) + 24*a(n-3) - 95*a(n-4) + 10*a(n-5) + 8*a(n-6) for n >= 6.
%F A288031 Empirical g.f.: (1 - 19*x - 77*x^2 - 15*x^3 + 54*x^4 - 8*x^5)/(1 - 20*x - 100*x^2 - 24*x^3 + 95*x^4 - 10*x^5 - 8*x^6). - _Colin Barker_, Jun 11 2017
%F A288031 The above empirical formulas are correct. The sequence satisfies a recurrence of order (2^3 + 2^ceiling(3/2))/2 = 6. - _Andrew Howroyd_, Jul 29 2026
%t A288031 LinearRecurrence[{20, 100, 24, -95, 10, 8}, {1, 1, 43, 969, 23663, 571099}, 20] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Jul 29 2026 *)
